SY_TALK("-nZ6StoUbBs",[[2,["1995-1225 Christmas Puja Talk, Ganapatipule, India,"]],[1468,["It is a great day when Christ came on this earth."]],[1477,["And you know about how He was specially created"]],[1486,["to come down as a human being to work out the salvation of the people."]],[1509,["It is said that He came to India, in Kashmir,"]],[1517,["and He met there the King Shalivahana."]],[1526,["It’s all in Sanskrit; I’ve read that the conversation took place between Christ and King Shalivahana,"]],[1539,["who was a great devotee of the Mother."]],[1545,["And he asked Him, “What is Your name?” In Sanskrit it’s all written."]],[1552,["So He said, “I come from a country where people believe in filth,"]],[1558,["and I think this is My own country.”"]],[1562,["So Shalivahana said, “You are such a great person, who has come on this earth,"]],[1571,["so You should go back to those countries to save them"]],[1577,["and to tell them about the pure principle of life.”"]],[1587,["In Sanskrit it was written Nirmala Tattwa."]],[1594,["And Christ went back, and after three and a half years only He was crucified."]],[1614,["These were special days, I call them the days of tapasya."]],[1623,["Same time Buddha and Mahavira were born,"]],[1627,["at the same level of the Virata’s forehead."]],[1636,["As you know that according to Vedas, there are seven awarenesses we can go through,"]],[1656,["or the subtle qualities we have within ourselves."]],[1663,["The first one was the Bhu. Bhu is Ganesha was created."]],[1672,["Second is Bhurvah, meaning antariksha, means “all that is created around us.”"]],[1686,["The third one is Swaha at Nabhi Chakra."]],[1691,["Swaha is the one where you consume everything."]],[1695,["Is in modern times, you see, people go on consuming everything."]],[1701,["All kinds of books they will read; they’ll go to all kinds of things,"]],[1705,["and if you tell them, “Why do you do it?”"]],[1707,["“What’s wrong?”"]],[1710,["“Why do you dress up like this?”"]],[1712,["“What’s wrong?”"]],[1714,["This just consumption of everything goes on."]],[1721,["But then at that time also there is"]],[1726,["another great thing within us is called as Swadha,"]],[1731,["where we sustain the dharma within us. Swadha."]],[1742,["Dharma of everything."]],[1745,["See, those people who say there should be no blind faith and this and that,"]],[1751,["it’s not blind, but it’s an inner urge."]],[1755,["Why we love our parents? Because there’s a dharma within us."]],[1760,["Why do we live, we live in our country?"]],[1764,["Because there’s a dharma within us."]],[1766,["All these dharmas are there. Why a wife loves her husband?"]],[1771,["Because there is dharma."]],[1774,["Why the husband loves the wife? Because there is dharma."]],[1777,["When this dharma is within you - we'll not call it religion"]],[1782,["because it can mean something else – this one is sustained, dharaiti."]],[1789,["Once it is sustained within ourselves, it becomes Swadha."]],[1795,["That’s our capacity; that’s our quality."]],[1798,["We can call it an innate understanding."]],[1804,["Some of them are even in the animals,"]],[1808,["like attachment to parents, attachment to their masters."]],[1819,["Then comes the higher awareness where your Manah - now it's not mind."]],[1828,["There’s very confusion; there’s a big confusion. Mind,"]],[1831,["you see, English language is really quite confusing."]],[1835,["Manah means “by which we have emotions.”"]],[1840,["Now recently I read that they are now talking about, not only of IQ"]],[1847,["but EQ, means emotional coefficience."]],[1852,["That means a person who has only intelligence is not all right,"]],[1858,["he must also have the balance of emotions. They are coming to it now."]],[1863,["But first they only used to praise people who have IQ."]],[1867,["That’s not the situation. So now it is different,"]],[1873,["perhaps they are realizing that through intelligence how people have created chaos, violence,"]],[1882,["all kinds of destruction on this earth."]],[1889,["So now they are talking about a higher capacity within us"]],[1894,["called as EQ, which capacity is emotional."]],[1899,["This emotional capacity comes to you as an inner urge,"]],[1910,["as an inner capability which you cannot avoid."]],[1918,["A person may be anything in life, but if he has no love,"]],[1926,["if he hasn’t got any emotional feelings, then he is not complete."]],[1936,["Now these emotional things also could be very limited, no doubt."]],[1943,["There could be something that get attached to somebody, or something can happen,"]],[1949,["as also the IQ, where we get attached to some idea."]],[1955,["Like Hitler had some idea, and he believed that it was the truth, and he has to do it."]],[1962,["So when you get attached to one idea like that,"]],[1967,["you can just do things which are not at all helpful, supportive or nourishing to reality."]],[1981,["All these things have happened: wars, destruction, also,"]],[1989,["as you see nowadays, the people are trying to secretly destroy others."]],[1996,["All these are coming as the anti-feeling"]],[2004,["where the Manah has developed a domination of the intelligence,"]],[2015,["where emotions are dominated by intelligence and rationality."]],[2027,["So there is another awareness within us, another capability within us,"]],[2032,["another urge within us, innately built is the Janah."]],[2037,["Janah means the people, the communication."]],[2043,["You cannot live alone; you see a man who goes to jail, he’s quite happy,"]],[2051,["he’s quite comfortable, he doesn’t have to do any work, everything is done for him"]],[2057,["if he has a good class, he lives very well, much better than he would live outside."]],[2064,["But the only thing is, he cannot meet other people, he cannot communicate."]],[2074,["And when this capacity of communication which is within us - I mean,"]],[2080,["which is a part and parcel of human existence - is taken away,"]],[2088,["a person in the jail feels absolutely frustrated and unhappy."]],[2100,["He doesn’t mind laboring, doing all kinds of menial work,"]],[2108,["as long as he’s not in the jail, cut out of the communications with others."]],[2120,["So this communication is also an inner urge within us."]],[2126,["In that also people sometimes go too far and neglect other dharmas."]],[2133,["They are more bothered about communication"]],[2135,["than about other dharmas which are very important."]],[2138,["So there is no balance in a person."]],[2146,["Then comes the sixth awareness within us, which is a very interesting thing."]],[2157,["One was where we take to conditionings."]],[2164,["Say, if I am an Indian, then I am very proud of Indians;"]],[2171,["I can never see anything wrong with them, or I may see everything wrong with them,"]],[2177,["it can be both ways."]],[2180,["How you have been conditioned is the point,"]],[2183,["and this conditioning comes to us through our sixth center of Agnya."]],[2192,["And the another thing that we develop"]],[2196,["when somebody tries to condition us or to control us,"]],[2203,["we try to get out of it, or sometimes we try to dominate."]],[2211,["This dominating capacity is also within us innately built."]],[2220,["Both things are innately built within us that we go on getting ourselves conditioned."]],[2231,["For example I would say that in very stupid, silly manner, people get conditioned,"]],[2238,["is impossible to get them out of it."]],[2243,["It always comes out of self-centeredness that a person has no value for understanding."]],[2256,["Like now somebody comes to your house, he’s a vegetarian,"]],[2262,["all right. Now he stays with you."]],[2265,["So, \"I’m a vegetarian, you must get new utensils to cook the food"]],[2271,["because I can’t have food in the utensils where the meat is cooked.”"]],[2277,["All right. Then, “You must get your servant in a proper manner,"]],[2285,["so send him to some place where you can get the well water.”"]],[2295,["The servant must be absolutely drenched - this is typical Indian old style -"]],[2302,["and should go and draw the water from the well, and “bring me it for drinking and cooking,”"]],[2311,["while the servant dies of pneumonia, doesn’t matter."]],[2315,["All such stupid conditionings we have,"]],[2320,["but it's not only that in the East you find all these conditionings - the West is even worse."]],[2326,["For example, they have clubbing."]],[2331,["Now, there are clubs where people wear particular type of clothes;"]],[2341,["it’s a club. Now, if they wear something else then everybody will laugh at them."]],[2348,["Or how to use the spoon and fork is very important in the West, how they use spoon and fork."]],[2356,["Specially English have this nonsensical conditioning."]],[2360,["If somebody uses the fork and spoon in a wrong way then, finished!"]],[2365,["He is nowhere; he is not sophisticated."]],[2370,["The ideas of sophistication and all that comes through conditioning of ages,"]],[2379,["because maybe they were primitive to begin with, they had no clothes,"]],[2385,["proper clothes to wear,"]],[2388,["might be they were covering themselves with some leaves or something,"]],[2395,["I mean, only hundreds of years back."]],[2401,["So now they have jumped to the other side, very particular about their dress,"]],[2407,["very particular about fork and spoon."]],[2413,["And they just can’t bear something that is different."]],[2420,["“I don’t like that,” is very common there, “I don’t like. I don’t like.”"]],[2426,["Now, they came to India, “We don’t like.”"]],[2429,["“What you don’t like?”"]],[2432,["“We don’t like the way Indians dress up.”"]],[2434,["“All right, you dress up the way you like,"]],[2437,["let Indians dress up the like they like."]],[2440,["Now why do you think that your dress in England will suit here in India,"]],[2446,["which is such a hot, hot, hot country?”"]],[2451,["But no, “This is how we are.” It’s quite funny the way they have,"]],[2456,["and this conditioning goes on into such a deep manner that nobody sees the stupidity behind it."]],[2468,["For example, if the Queen has invited you, you must wear a tailcoat,"]],[2474,["and now it's very expensive to have a tailcoat."]],[2478,["Now, they have to go to a particular shop to borrow it."]],[2482,["Sometimes they're loose, and sometimes they're tight."]],[2486,["I have seen people coming to these parties, Queen’s parties,"]],[2491,["I could never recognize them because somebody looked like Charlie Chaplin,"]],[2496,["or somebody looked like Laurel, or somebody like Hardy."]],[2501,["I couldn’t make out who are these people."]],[2504,["Then I was told, “He's that such and such ambassador.”"]],[2507,["“Oh my God, I know him very well, what has happened to him?”"]],[2510,["They cannot walk straight,"]],[2512,["their gait changes because of the clothes which are so tight sometimes, and sometimes so loose."]],[2520,["But you have to wear."]],[2522,["All these formal ideas come to us as a kind of a part and parcel of you,"]],[2529,["because you accept all these conditionings."]],[2533,["So the other side it goes to, that we abandon all this,"]],[2539,["we don’t want all, we're anti-culture."]],[2543,["So I met one gentleman who was wearing a pant which had lots of holes in it."]],[2547,["Imagine in the cold of London to wear a pant like that."]],[2552,["So I said, “Why do you want to wear a pant which has holes?”"]],[2558,["He said, “This is a holy pant.\""]],[2560,["“Holey?"]],[2563,["My goodness, it will give you varicose veins, it's horrible.”"]],[2568,["“What’s wrong?"]],[2570,["We are anti-culture people so we are taking now to holey pants.”"]],[2576,["I mean, such stupid people are not only who are uneducated,"]],[2580,["but very well educated people, highly-placed people, are so conditioned,"]],[2587,["and this conditioning has caused so much damage to human beings."]],[2593,["For example, to accept Freud had become just a complete religion in the West."]],[2600,["Freud became Christ at that level, though he was a Jew."]],[2607,["And he dominated the Western culture so much"]],[2612,["that I just couldn’t understand the impact of this stupid man"]],[2617,["who would have been thrown in the sea if he had come to India."]],[2621,["But the conditioning part is: \"Everything is written is law,\""]],[2626,["and they accepted this man so much"]],[2630,["that the culture of the West became absolutely self-destructive throughout."]],[2637,["No respect, no morality, nothing was lofty,"]],[2643,["all value systems shattered"]],[2648,["because they accepted this kind of nonsense because it was written."]],[2654,["Even today I hear, “In such and such book, such is written;"]],[2658,["in that book such and such thing is written.” This is terrible condition."]],[2663,["For example, it’s written in the Bible that Jews crucified Christ."]],[2668,["Nonsense! Just use your brains. How can Jews crucify Christ?"]],[2674,["They were in the multitude."]],[2676,["In any country have you heard that a person can be crucified"]],[2682,["with the general opinion of the people?"]],[2684,["It’s the government, the Roman government did that."]],[2688,["But to put the blame on the Jews was a very good idea"]],[2692,["of a very cunning man called as Mr. Paul,"]],[2695,["and people accepted that because it suited them to hate the Jews."]],[2700,["Then the Jews started creating people like Freud."]],[2704,["So all such conditionings also have reactions,"]],[2708,["and these conditionings then build up, and once they build up,"]],[2712,["their reactions also build up and you have a country full of all kinds of chaos,"]],[2718,["fear, violence and destruction."]],[2726,["The conditioning is more also with the idea of possession:"]],[2732,["“This is my land."]],[2734,["This possession is mine. That is this, that.”"]],[2739,["Like this it goes up to a point where people"]],[2742,["who believed in the formless God also fight for the land."]],[2747,["Why should they? They believe in the formless God,"]],[2751,["so why should they fight for the land?"]],[2754,["But they’ll go on fighting for the land,"]],[2756,["and this fighting for the land can go to any extent of very cruel things"]],[2766,["that whole country can work out."]],[2772,["Conditionings are of every kind, if you see, are blinding your eyes."]],[2783,["For example they believe in Koran."]],[2786,["Simple thing is, Koran was never written by Mohammed Sahib."]],[2790,["He never knew how to read and write."]],[2795,["It’s a fact."]],[2797,["For forty years it was not written."]],[2800,["There was a fellow called Mua’wiya or something like that,"]],[2804,["who killed Hazrat Ali, his sons."]],[2808,["He was the second Calipha; the first one died very early."]],[2814,["Then he killed the third one also."]],[2819,["Then he killed the fourth one, just to become himself the Calipha,"]],[2824,["and the liver of this fourth Calipha was eaten"]],[2829,["by the mother of this horrible fellow who hated women."]],[2835,["So he puts it down in the Koran, all the things against women,"]],[2840,["and people accept it because it’s in the Koran."]],[2843,["Somebody has made fun of Koran and written what's wrong,"]],[2847,["and it’s so stupidities, and all that."]],[2850,["So I asked him, \"What is the use of writing this book, what is the use?\""]],[2854,["He said he never thought of the use."]],[2857,["“Then why did you write? It must have some use. It’s a useless book.”"]],[2862,["I said, \"It is only useful that, by reading this, all the people who are not Muslims,"]],[2870,["will laugh at Islam, and those who are Muslims will say, 'Well, this is our book,"]],[2881,["whatever it says we believe in it, we are conditioned like that.'"]],[2886,["So you don’t solve the problem.\""]],[2888,["So he said, “Then what should I do?”"]],[2890,["I said, \"You write another book, saying"]],[2893,["This is all stupidity I've written of Koran,"]],[2897,["because I know it was not written by Mohammed Sahib.'"]],[2901,["Don’t write anything Mohammed Sahib, against Him."]],[2905,["He is the One who is the incarnation of Dattatreya. It’s a fact."]],[2910,["So you write that He never wrote it, so all these people have done all these things.\""]],[2917,["This conditioning can be removed"]],[2922,["if you know what sort of life Christ led."]],[2925,["Very important."]],[2929,["First of all He was born in a manger."]],[2933,["To be born in a manger means in a poor circumstance."]],[2940,["That means He showed there’s no need to have money"]],[2944,["or there’s no need to have a huge, big properties"]],[2950,["or anything to be impressive on people."]],[2955,["Those were the days where people respected the tapasvis, the ones who were doing tapasya."]],[2965,["That was the time to do tapasya."]],[2968,["So He came on this earth and lived like a tapasvi."]],[2976,["On the contrary, the Christians are the most self-indulgent people you could think of."]],[2985,["You go to any Christian nation, you will be amazed"]],[2989,["how they are just slaves of money and their watches."]],[2997,["How they are living is very shocking to see they are following Christ."]],[3004,["“Yes, we follow Christ.”"]],[3007,["Then follow means what?"]],[3010,["He’s there and you are standing backwards moving."]],[3013,["Is that the following?"]],[3016,["If you see the Catholic Church, or even Protestants, you’ll be shocked."]],[3022,["How are they following Christ? I can’t understand, until now I never understood,"]],[3027,["because Catholic is nothing but money-oriented."]],[3031,["The only thing they have picked up from Christ that He went to a wedding"]],[3035,["and created wine out of water and distributed."]],[3044,["Now this wine is just the juice of the grapes."]],[3052,["It’s also called wine in the Hebrew language."]],[3056,["Thank God I have read Bible in Hebrew translated directly."]],[3060,["So it's called draksharas."]],[3064,["Because instantly, you cannot create alcohol."]],[3071,["It has to rot, rot, rot, and the more it rots, the more good it is, they say."]],[3078,["They write it down, this is twenty-five years old, so is the price is much."]],[3083,["But if it is three hundred year old the price is exorbitant."]],[3087,["So it has to rot and smell like hell, then only it’s a good alcohol. It’s a fact."]],[3094,["How could Christ create that instant, that moment, alcohol?"]],[3099,["But now what I find is this, that if somebody dies"]],[3103,["they will take champagne to celebrate what?"]],[3106,["Good riddance of bad rubbish? Or when somebody is born they will do it."]],[3113,["But on Christmas day especially, after coming from church,"]],[3117,["don’t go to any Christian’s house."]],[3122,["Even the Indian Christians have started following the Western people,"]],[3126,["because Indian Christians believe that Christ was born in England."]],[3133,["All such ideas have come from where?"]],[3137,["Is because the English and the Portuguese and the French brought Christianity to us."]],[3144,["Now, by any chance, are they Christians?"]],[3148,["What business they had to bring Christianity to this place?"]],[3155,["They took Christianity to all the places, specially Spanish."]],[3159,["Spanish, Portuguese went round the whole world"]],[3164,["to spread Christianity and today is the mess"]],[3167,["that you see in those people. They are nothing but drunkards."]],[3173,["Yesterday I was going back, and the sea was full of happiness and joy,"]],[3182,["and the water had reached a very high level. It happens with Me."]],[3187,["But what I found, there were four, five Christians coming, singing carols,"]],[3191,["and just completely drunk, and I was thinking they’ll be drowned in this water very soon."]],[3201,["This was the great boon of Christianity on human beings,"]],[3206,["that you can drink as much as you like."]],[3213,["Now this drinking has come, I should say, from where? God alone knows,"]],[3218,["but it has come also from the Christians."]],[3223,["And the Muslims also drink, no doubt,"]],[3226,["but they hide and drink."]],[3229,["They don’t openly drink and don’t call it's a religious duty that you should drink."]],[3234,["Imagine in the church when they give communication,"]],[3237,["they give you some sort of a dirty smelling wine."]],[3242,["After that, how can you have communication?"]],[3245,["Once you are drunk you are finished."]],[3249,["But all these things happen."]],[3252,["So today we are talking about Christ."]],[3255,["He is sitting in a position of Agnya Chakra,"]],[3263,["controlling pineal and pituitary."]],[3268,["By that He controls our conditioning."]],[3273,["If we follow Him then we cannot be conditioned by anything,"]],[3280,["because He talked of Spirit only."]],[3283,["Spirit cannot be conditioned - conditioned by anything."]],[3290,["Whatever is good that will be accepted, good, congenial to the Spirit."]],[3301,["It’s a different attitude of a person who is spiritual."]],[3306,["Like we had people here,"]],[3311,["I know they are not very comfortable."]],[3316,["Some of them are put into these tents here and there,"]],[3320,["but they are enjoying because they are enjoying the spiritual atmosphere."]],[3330,["They don’t care where they sleep, where they live, what they have."]],[3335,["This is all because you have entered into the Kingdom of God."]],[3340,["But those who have not, so much worried,"]],[3343,["“This is not good, I want this way, that way.” All material happiness they seek,"]],[3350,["trouble everybody, criticize everybody, get angry with everybody."]],[3355,["But actually they haven’t got spiritual joy,"]],[3360,["and they can never be really in joy unless and until they become fully spiritual."]],[3368,["Christ has openly said that “You have to know yourself.”"]],[3374,["Same in Koran, Mohammed Sahib has said,"]],[3377,["“Unless and until you know yourself, you will not know God.”"]],[3381,["There are lots of truths in Koran, I find, left over by this Mua’wiya"]],[3388,["and also in the Bible."]],[3391,["Also in the Jews, I find their Torah and all that has lots of truth,"]],[3397,["but is covered by all this kind of thinking,"]],[3401,["rationality and adjustments they have done for their own use."]],[3410,["Actually we have to understand that Christ never started any exclusive religion, never."]],[3417,["None of them. Specially Mohammed Sahib has talked about Abraham;"]],[3424,["He’s talked about Moses; He’s talked about Christ and His Mother, much more than in the Bible,"]],[3431,["respected Her."]],[3433,["And He said, “There have been more than one lakh walis (means realized souls) before.”"]],[3440,["But still Muslims are some sort of a unique people"]],[3447,["because they call themselves Muslims. Whether they drink, doesn’t matter;"]],[3451,["whether they womanize, doesn’t matter;"]],[3454,["they kill people, doesn’t matter."]],[3456,["They are running after few things which are forbidden to them,"]],[3460,["but still they are Muslims."]],[3462,["Same with the Christians."]],[3464,["Difficult to find a man who is a real Christian, who follows Christ, before realization."]],[3475,["After realization, of course, we are different,"]],[3478,["but for that you have to cross this Agnya."]],[3481,["Agnya also is there which has to control your ego."]],[3489,["Christ in His lifetime showed how ego works."]],[3494,["His own crucifixion itself shows how Christ,"]],[3502,["such a great incarnation of purity, was crucified;"]],[3507,["shows what people are like,"]],[3512,["what they did to Him, how He was troubled"]],[3518,["and tortured by these stupid people"]],[3521,["and then how He was crucified by the government."]],[3528,["In the beginning there were many Sahaja Yogis, I should say, they were called as Gnostics."]],[3533,["\"Gna” in Sanskrit means knowledge, who had the knowledge about self."]],[3541,["Christ has said, “Thou shalt.” He has said that “Know thyself.”"]],[3547,["\"You have to knock at the door,” meaning"]],[3551,["you must have Shuddha Iccha, otherwise it won’t work out."]],[3554,["Nobody can force you. He controls the ego."]],[3562,["He’s the One who gives you the balance,"]],[3567,["but if you go to the West you know they are nothing"]],[3571,["but some sort of a stupid donkey-like ego."]],[3578,["The way they talk, the way they behave towards each other, it’s a big eye opener."]],[3586,["They are developed. How are they developed? God knows."]],[3590,["Oh, they are very advanced, sophisticated, this, that."]],[3597,["With this Agnya catching. Christ has said in His Lord’s Prayer:"]],[3604,["“Forgive us our trespasses as we forgive them who trespass against us.”"]],[3613,["What a big thing to say, but one thing I have seen in the West,"]],[3618,["people don’t know how to forgive."]],[3620,["They are full of hatred"]],[3626,["and they cannot ask forgiveness because they are full of terrible ego."]],[3634,["Though they will feel guilty, but they will never ask for forgiveness."]],[3639,["They’ll never say that “Oh God, forgive me for what I have done. ”"]],[3645,["This is so common now."]],[3648,["For example the Nazis, they killed so many people"]],[3652,["and still you find these Neo-Nazis coming up, even in Italy."]],[3662,["They are not ashamed as to what they have done."]],[3666,["This happens because there is no really connection with Christ."]],[3673,["Firstly, if you have connection with Christ,"]],[3677,["your ego has to be finished, absolutely."]],[3682,["And this ego which comes to you from various sources is a myth. Is a myth."]],[3692,["With this ego people try to befool others and show off."]],[3698,["Like there’s a story of Shahpesh- I don’t know if you have read about him."]],[3703,["He came to a king and told him that “I’m a great architect,"]],[3707,["and I’ll build a big palace for you, ”and this and that."]],[3710,["The way he posed, the king believed him."]],[3713,["He said, “All right. Go ahead, I’ll send you so much money. ”"]],[3717,["Now with this whole attitude and the way he was describing himself,"]],[3724,["with his all his gestures full of such ego"]],[3728,["that this king also got completely lost. He gave him lots of money."]],[3735,["And in six months' time he came back, said, “I’ve built your palace, come and have a look.”"]],[3741,["So he went there, he saw it was just the same land, there was no palace, nothing."]],[3747,["So the king thought something gone wrong with him or what?"]],[3750,["He was again looking and looking, and what does he find? He finds there was no palace, nothing."]],[3756,["Immediately he realized that his ego has befooled him."]],[3761,["So the king was very clever that way, he realized it."]],[3767,["So he started saying, “See this is the main road by which we’ll go, and there’s the palace."]],[3773,["Now the door opens. ”Nothing there."]],[3776,["It's all just a story. “And now here is your throne,"]],[3780,["and please be seated on it.”"]],[3782,["He said, “First you sit.”"]],[3785,["He made this Shahpesh to sit on a throne which never existed. Now imagine, it was very painful."]],[3795,["He said, “You see, I want to see you sitting there, I like it.”"]],[3800,["For one hour he made him sit."]],[3802,["For two hours he made him sit. Ultimately Shahpesh fell at his feet and he said,"]],[3808,["“Sir, I’m sorry, there is no palace, there is no throne, nothing of the kind,”"]],[3815,["but the king had lost all his money so he imprisoned him,"]],[3819,["he was beaten up and did all kinds of things."]],[3822,["So this is the end of false ideas about oneself."]],[3828,["This ego can take you to such a heights of stupidity."]],[3838,["And the culture where it is pampered is the worst culture."]],[3845,["I’ve seen advertisements where they say,"]],[3848,["\"You must smoke this particular cigarette because it expresses your ego.\""]],[3857,["But according to Indian culture, to express your ego is absolutely something very stupid."]],[3869,["People laugh at such a person, the one who tries to show his ego."]],[3875,["In Marathi language, if somebody is trying to show off,"]],[3880,["then they say he is climbing on a small, little shrub of channa."]],[3888,["It’s the whole system is such so nobody can develop any ego."]],[3895,["If they develop, then they are corrected."]],[3899,["Specially in Maharashtra, it’s very difficult to develop any ego."]],[3904,["As soon as you start talking big about yourself, immediately you are punctured."]],[3912,["But in the north, of course, a little bit allowed I think, and people do talk big."]],[3924,["We have great politicians who talk very big,"]],[3927,["“I’m going to do this; I’m going to do that. We’re going to have this project, that project, this, that.”"]],[3933,["One thing: Christ never said such a thing, never He talked."]],[3937,["What, if you see His sermons, is so deep and so enlightening."]],[3947,["Despite the effort of this gentleman Mister Paul,"]],[3951,["you see Christ talking to people,"]],[3955,["giving them different ways of explanation: what happens after realization,"]],[3964,["how a seed is sprouted, and how it can get spoilt."]],[3968,["And very beautifully He explained to people."]],[3973,["I think it didn't have much effect at that time."]],[3977,["0"]],[3998,["His life was so charming and so beautiful."]],[4004,["Like a shooting star, He came on this earth,"]],[4010,["but He left such a remarkable impression on people."]],[4019,["His crucifixion was a part of the game"]],[4022,["because He had to make the way in the Agnya Chakra,"]],[4028,["to cross the Agnya Chakra He was crucified;"]],[4032,["but His message is not crucifixion."]],[4037,["People wear the cross and I feel very hurt about it."]],[4041,["He crucified Himself, but that’s not the message,"]],[4046,["that’s not you should celebrate that He crucified. There are people who celebrate it."]],[4054,["You have to celebrate His resurrection,"]],[4058,["resurrection because human beings are to be resurrected."]],[4065,["In Sahaja Yoga nobody is crucified"]],[4068,["and is resurrected because of one crucifixion of Christ."]],[4073,["That was enough. That was sufficient."]],[4077,["You can’t carry the cross on your shoulder; don’t have to."]],[4082,["He has carried for you, He’s done everything for you."]],[4085,["He said also that He died for all the sinners, is a fact. If"]],[4089,["He had not done that, it would have been difficult to open your Agnyas,"]],[4095,["because two problems, I told you, this conditioning and ego."]],[4102,["His crucifixion has helped"]],[4105,["the loosening of these two horrible capacities of human being."]],[4117,["His life is to be understood in a very, very deep sense."]],[4131,["But if you are like a journalist, you can say,"]],[4134,["“Why did He crucify Himself? If He was God why did He get crucified?”"]],[4143,["Now the question is why He got crucified,"]],[4146,["is how to tell these journalists who don’t know anything about chakras."]],[4151,["Because it was the era or the time of tapasya, of sacrifice, and so"]],[4160,["then all these three persons - Buddha, Mahavira and Christ - went into complete renunciation."]],[4175,["They led a life of a great tapasvis."]],[4181,["They did it for us, not for themselves. They didn’t need it."]],[4187,["They didn’t want it; but they had do it to cleanse us,"]],[4194,["to give us a proper Medha as they call it this Ekadesha Rudras,"]],[4205,["you see, to be cleared out;"]],[4208,["and they have sacrificed their lives, they have sacrificed all the pleasures of life."]],[4215,["For them it was not a sacrifice, it is just a kind of a life they wanted to have."]],[4221,["For such people there’s no question of sacrifice, but is a question of doing something"]],[4229,["that would help to open the chakras of the people in the future."]],[4236,["Without them we could not have worked out Sahaja Yoga."]],[4239,["It was essential for these people to cleanse for us these three chakras,"]],[4249,["part of the one Chakra of Christ."]],[4256,["All this they have worked out, and that's why today Sahaja Yoga is so beautifully created,"]],[4267,["so beautifully spreading, is working out. We have to thank them very much."]],[4274,["Of course all other incarnations also have helped,"]],[4277,["you can see, Vishuddhi, then also heart, and all these - right heart, left heart -"]],[4283,["all these angels as they are called in the Bible,"]],[4288,["have helped us to cross over."]],[4291,["All these incarnations are responsible in our evolutionary process"]],[4296,["to create these ladders for us to move."]],[4302,["So, ultimately you reach the state of Tapah"]],[4310,["on the sixth center and then in the state of truth, Satya."]],[4317,["Then the truth comes to you through Sahaja Yoga, in the brain,"]],[4323,["in the limbic area when the Kundalini enters, She puts light there,"]],[4328,["She creates enlightened personalities"]],[4333,["and then She joins this all-pervading power of divine love,"]],[4339,["and with this divine love you are completely changed and transformed."]],[4350,["So their contribution to the ascent of human beings has been great,"]],[4359,["and that of Christ has been the greatest."]],[4362,["And when we say we have to follow Christ,"]],[4368,["we should try to see how much detachment we have."]],[4376,["They say His brothers and sisters, or somebody came to see Him."]],[4381,["They say He had brothers. So He said, “Who are My brothers?"]],[4386,["These are My brothers, these are My relations.”"]],[4390,["Gyaneshwara said the same thing, that \"They will become your relations"]],[4396,["[Marathi, sounds like SO ERIKO, TE CHEEZ SO ERIKO TE]. They will be your relations,"]],[4402,["they'll be your brothers and sisters, and not those who are not enlightened."]],[4408,["They are not your relations because they don’t understand you."]],[4411,["They don’t have entry into the Kingdom of God,"]],[4419,["so they are not your relations.\" In His lifetime, He led a life of a person who was very simple."]],[4432,["Didn’t bother about clothes or anything."]],[4435,["All the conditioning of the worldly things were not His,"]],[4439,["but He was not shameless type of a person who would accept any kind of a nudity and this and that."]],[4446,["Even about Mahavira there’s a big misconcept."]],[4452,["He was once praying in a garden where there were lots of bushes, we call them kunjas,"]],[4461,["and in the bush His cloth, which was only one cloth He was putting on, was caught up."]],[4468,["So He cut half of it and was covering Himself."]],[4471,["Shri Krishna went to test Him, and He said that “I have nothing, I am just nude,"]],[4479,["so why don’t you give Me your cloth? Because, after all, You are a king.”"]],[4486,["So He took out his cloth and gave it to Shri Krishna, and got some leaves to cover Himself"]],[4496,["and He was in His own garden, and went into His own palace."]],[4500,["Now, if you see the Jains, they make everything so horrible and insult Him all the time."]],[4508,["Most of the people who follow all these great incarnations really all the time insult them."]],[4518,["They don’t follow, they insult, and by their behavior, you see,"]],[4523,["we form such a bad opinion of all these people."]],[4529,["I met one gentleman in Chicago. It was very cold."]],[4533,["He was the head of the Hare Rama Hare Krishna."]],[4537,["He was wearing a dhoti which was so thin, and he was shaking before Me."]],[4543,["I said, “What’s the matter?”"]],[4547,["He said, “I’m feeling very cold.”"]],[4549,["I said, “Why are you wearing this dhoti?”"]],[4551,["He said, “My guru has told me if you wear a dhoti you will go to heaven.”"]],[4556,["I said, “Really? In India eighty percent people wear nothing but dhotis,"]],[4562,["are they all going to go to heaven? And many must have gone already,"]],[4565,["so where will you be?” Didn’t like it."]],[4569,["Then I said, \"Why you shaved your hair and put this …”we call it shindi, or in Hindi, bhodi."]],[4575,["I don’t know what you call - pig’s tail here, pig’s tail?"]],[4580,["So he says, “It is because my guru told me"]],[4583,["that I must shave my head and have this kind of a thing.” So I think perhaps,"]],[4589,["maybe he will be tied to some rope and pulled in the heaven or something,"]],[4597,["I said. Kabira has said - Kabira was one of them who has tried to slash out all your conditioning."]],[4609,["He said, “By shaving your head, if you are going to go to heaven,"]],[4617,["so what about the lamb which is shaved twice a year?"]],[4626,["He’ll be there earlier than you.”"]],[4630,["It’s a fact, it's so, such stupid things."]],[4632,["And there are Jain sadhus who will remain absolutely nude and will pull their hair."]],[4638,["Now by law they are allowed to go nude on the street, you know, insulting everyone."]],[4646,["All such stupid things are happening in the name of religion -"]],[4651,["that, too, of Buddha, Mahavira, and Christ."]],[4657,["They are the Ones who are trying to pull us away from rationality,"]],[4665,["because you have to cross this."]],[4668,["All your limitations are because of this thinking, conditioning."]],[4678,["We have to go beyond because by thinking, what do we do?"]],[4685,["We move in a linear way and then there’s no truth in it,"]],[4690,["so the whole thing comes back, boomerangs, and you are finished."]],[4696,["We have to go beyond this mind; must understand this point is."]],[4701,["Christ has done this so that we can go beyond our mind."]],[4708,["If you don’t know how to go beyond mind,"]],[4711,["better sit down for your meditation, work it out."]],[4714,["With this mind all kinds of things will come."]],[4717,["Temper will come, intrigue will come, jealousies will come,"]],[4724,["all the six enemies that we have will come to us through this mind –"]],[4735,["means thinking, rationality. Everything can be rationalized."]],[4741,["“Why did you murder your wife?”"]],[4745,["\"Because I hated her. She was this, she was that, she was that.”"]],[4748,["But you cannot murder her."]],[4751,["“Why did you murder your husband?” “Because of this, because of that.”"]],[4755,["Because of this mind we start doing things which are absolutely wrong, which are sinful,"]],[4763,["and then we try to rationalize it."]],[4766,["Go against Agnya, go against reality,"]],[4772,["and then use your conditioning, use your, we can call,"]],[4778,["the ego to explain it, why you did it."]],[4787,["All the time when we are doing like that we can never go beyond mind."]],[4792,["We are so self-satisfied about ourselves. We think no end of ourselves."]],[4798,["Now, how are we to get out of it?"]],[4807,["Introspection."]],[4810,["But it’s very difficult because people are afraid of themselves."]],[4814,["They don’t want to introspect, because once they start introspecting they"]],[4819,["will know how sinful they have been, how wrong things they have been doing."]],[4826,["And then they’ll hate themselves. So they don’t want to introspect."]],[4832,["But it’s very important that we should introspect."]],[4839,["That introspection is very helpful for you to overcome these two hurdles of your Agnya Chakra."]],[4853,["I’ve told you many a times: don’t argue with anybody"]],[4858,["because the other fellow, he is asking for argument is the one has lots of ego,"]],[4863,["and that ego is acting on you."]],[4868,["So action/reaction starts, and we develop a habit of reacting to everything."]],[4877,["Specially in the West, I have seen they react to everything, everything."]],[4882,["For example, now, this thing is spread out here, now they have nothing to do."]],[4886,["“But they could have had better, why is it so thin?”"]],[4890,["Well you pay for it now, you do it."]],[4894,["They are walking across, they meet someone. \"See, see this man."]],[4897,["What sort of a person he is?”"]],[4901,["If there’s a beggar, then they’ll start criticizing."]],[4905,["They'll criticize the government; they’ll criticize everyone."]],[4909,["What about yourself?"]],[4911,["Instead of that why don’t you start doing something about it?"]],[4916,["If you can’t help it, if you are not going to do anything about it, why react?"]],[4922,["And this is the worst habit we have developed is to react,"]],[4926,["and we think we have every right to react."]],[4929,["You have, but this right is self-destructive."]],[4938,["To react on everything is not proper."]],[4943,["You have no authority to react. It is to that extent."]],[4948,["You have to just witness, witness the whole thing."]],[4953,["Once you start witnessing,"]],[4956,["you’ll be amazed that you will start seeing the play, play of the maya,"]],[4963,["as they call it, and you will see where you stand with it."]],[4968,["Witnessing should be developed. All the time, witness."]],[4973,["Am I witnessing?"]],[4976,["Many people say that I have very good memory"]],[4979,["because I am all the time witnessing."]],[4984,["Everything is recorded within Me like a picture."]],[4989,["And then, when I have to say something, I have to correct something,"]],[4994,["all that I have witnessed comes to help Me."]],[5001,["First of all, we should not react, react to anything."]],[5007,["Some people are attached, say, to money."]],[5012,["They’ll react, they’ll not give any money,"]],[5015,["they’ll keep all the money with themselves."]],[5018,["In Sahaja Yoga also it happens."]],[5022,["I’ve seen people who are very, very miserly about money."]],[5026,["Another ones are who try to please others,"]],[5030,["then they’ll waste their money on lavish things for nothing at all."]],[5034,["There’s no need to waste."]],[5039,["Reaction can come through anything. Seeing something you can react"]],[5048,["and you become so engrossed with it that you don’t realize"]],[5053,["that you are wasting all your brain energy on nonsensical things."]],[5059,["This reaction comes when you have lost complete sense of judgment."]],[5068,["You don’t know what you are losing, what you are gaining by this kind of reaction."]],[5076,["And this reaction is going to destroy your inner being completely,"]],[5085,["because all the time you are here and you are there, and you’re there, and you are there,"]],[5089,["and you are nowhere here."]],[5094,["If you are a very criticizing type of a person, try to stop it completely. Criticize yourself,"]],[5101,["direct that energy towards yourself. \"Who am I to criticize others?"]],[5106,["Who am I to react to anything?"]],[5110,["”Put a challenge to yourself, and you will see that your ego will subside."]],[5124,["One day somebody came and told Me that"]],[5127,["“Mother I feel so angry, I feel like beating everyone.”"]],[5132,["I said, “All right, do one thing. Take a chappel and hit on your head. Finished."]],[5138,["That’s the only way you can get rid of this habit that you want to beat others.”"]],[5145,["Didn’t like it much, but I think by that he is improved."]],[5152,["Now, conditioning also should be seen. “Am I a conditioned person?"]],[5161,["If my conditioning is there, then is it a good conditioning or a bad conditioning?"]],[5166,["“At least you should have good conditioning."]],[5169,["But even that, to an extreme if you go,"]],[5171,["you can create a problem for yourself and for others."]],[5176,["Most of these rituals and things started as a good conditioning."]],[5182,["Then it became like a trap, and they could not get out of it."]],[5192,["It’s a part and parcel of it, one has to accept."]],[5197,["Then what should we do?"]],[5200,["We should not react. Just see the drama and you’ll be surprised,"]],[5210,["without paying anything, without going to any theatre, every moment you can see the drama going on before you,"]],[5217,["which is so enjoyable, whether it is absurd, whether it is ridiculous,"]],[5224,["whether it is a sort of a - as you see in the films, you see, beating somebody and all that,"]],[5233,["you just see it and you do not react."]],[5240,["Anything that you think is very perverse, ugly, immoral - don’t see, finished, gone."]],[5250,["So don’t tax your mind, because in the mind that we call it, so-called mind,"]],[5256,["it's actually the Agnya Chakra in the center of your optic chiasma."]],[5268,["Just imagine. What a central place it has!"]],[5272,["And any disturbance to your Agnya, what it can do to your brain"]],[5277,["which is nothing but a lump of fat."]],[5285,["So how this Agnya can affect you,"]],[5288,["and how it works and creates perverted images, that is to be really seen."]],[5296,["Conditionings, also you have seen, people are mentally so upset and so degenerated."]],[5307,["But the pure nature of Christ is innocence, you know that. He's Shri Ganesha."]],[5314,["Shri Ganesha is an eternal Child."]],[5319,["Christ is also complete innocence because He doesn’t react,"]],[5328,["because He is not conditioned."]],[5333,["Children are not conditioned so much as we are."]],[5339,["If you talk to children, if you speak to them,"]],[5342,["you’ll be amazed how innocent they are and how innocently they talk."]],[5349,["Once My granddaughter asked Me, “What do You think of the poor children of the tiger?”"]],[5357,["I said, “Why?”"]],[5359,["“You know their father tells them that ‘You eat human beings,’ and what can they do?"]],[5368,["They have to eat human beings after all.” You see, so innocent."]],[5373,["So I told her that they are under a complete control of God."]],[5378,["Whatever they are doing, they are not going to be held responsible."]],[5383,["It’s only for human beings"]],[5395,["that God has given this freedom."]],[5399,["It’s only human beings who can react in this manner."]],[5406,["So for animals it is, they are pashus,"]],[5410,["means they are completely under the control of the God Almighty."]],[5416,["So they are swabhavas, everything, a serpent will be a serpent,"]],[5421,["and a tiger will be a tiger, and they will say a lion will be a lion."]],[5427,["But human being can be a serpent, at the same time could be a scorpion,"]],[5432,["could be a lion, could be anything,"]],[5435,["you know suddenly you find a small little bug-like man coming up like a lion roaring at you,"]],[5442,["and you say, “From where does this come, this cannon?”"]],[5447,["It is so. You don’t know which way they will come,"]],[5451,["and which way the camel will sit. You can’t say."]],[5457,["So this reaction of human beings comes"]],[5465,["because he is not in connection with the Divine."]],[5470,["When he is in the connection with the Divine,"]],[5475,["he sees the drama, and he leaves everything to Divine."]],[5480,["He can solve all his problem by just one bandhan."]],[5487,["He can solve all the problems just by a bandhan."]],[5494,["But he should be in full connection with the Divine."]],[5500,["It works, it works. It does work. This is not the time when Christ came on this earth."]],[5508,["This is the time where this Paramchaitanya has gone into action – activated,"]],[5519,["is working out everything."]],[5521,["Now they asked Me about this Shri Ganesha, whether Shri Ganesha drank milk or not."]],[5528,["I said, “Anything possible.”"]],[5530,["These days this Paramachaitanya is doing such things, unbelievable things,"]],[5535,["which we cannot understand, everything is a chamatkar. So it’s possible."]],[5543,["Ganeshas, I’ve never heard of Ganesha liking milk so much,"]],[5548,["but maybe for the little rat He might be taking. Can’t say."]],[5554,["“But why did Shiva drink?”"]],[5556,["I said, “Let it be, let Shiva wants to drink, let Him have milk.”"]],[5560,["Actually we have too much milk production,"]],[5563,["so They must be wanting to consume some."]],[5565,["But it’s just a way at looking at things that, you see,"]],[5570,["when everything is done by this Paramchaitanya."]],[5574,["They are doing such wonderful things,"]],[5576,["I mean, I never asked Them to do anything."]],[5579,["But now, for example, in Brisbane when I was there,"]],[5582,["I was sleeping in the ashram, and a rainbow appeared."]],[5589,["Of course I like paintings very much, of Raphael specially,"]],[5592,["because he has drawn the Mother’s face,"]],[5597,["and the Child’s face so exactly,"]],[5600,["expressing the feeling of mother and the child."]],[5604,["And imagine, that picture appears in the sky,"]],[5609,["and I didn’t tell them to show that Raphael."]],[5612,["When I was sleeping I was not even going to look at it."]],[5616,["But at this time, the halo that was on the back side of Mary comes upon the head."]],[5623,["Means Raphael himself did it, or, I don’t know. How can I explain?"]],[5629,["This Paramchaitanya is doing all kinds of things,"]],[5633,["and it does all this just to convince you about Sahaja Yoga."]],[5641,["Because even now there are many who are supposed to be very rational, intelligent,"]],[5646,["educated, who don’t want to accept."]],[5652,["After all, if there is a divine power, if there is something like  that and is active,"]],[5657,["how can you challenge it?"]],[5660,["How can you say no to it?"]],[5664,["Because the powers are unlimited, it has gone into every atom and every molecule."]],[5678,["It doesn’t do tricks, like moving this from there to there,"]],[5683,["but what it does is to do something which is absolutely impossible."]],[5691,["It is doing."]],[5695,["So for us to believe in this activated Paramchaitanya"]],[5705,["is the only solution."]],[5707,["So you leave it in the ocean of bliss,"]],[5710,["and let this great power handle all these situations."]],[5714,["Don’t react yourself."]],[5718,["Which is so efficient, so quick, so fast, moves all over, understands everything,"]],[5724,["and it loves you and respects you because you are Sahaja Yogis."]],[5733,["This is what it is today: we should know at the time when we are celebrating Christmas"]],[5740,["that what we are celebrating is really our own ascent, our own achievements,"]],[5749,["our own lofty heights which we have achieved and which we have to achieve."]],[5757,["We should have only aspirations as far as our spiritual side is concerned."]],[5762,["All aspirations should be left to this Paramchaitanya,"]],[5767,["“You look after that.”"]],[5769,["And the more you become,"]],[5771,["the more you develop this non-reacting attitude through your proper Agnya."]],[5783,["Not anger, not silence, but a very pleasant temperament."]],[5791,["That means people think that I have told you not to speak. No, no, you must speak."]],[5795,["You must talk to people, you must laugh, you must enjoy;"]],[5799,["but all this should be full of joyous feelings."]],[5805,["That’s what they say that Christmas is for a very joyous atmosphere."]],[5815,["So they can’t do that way so they drink. I mean, after all,"]],[5819,["you must give them benefit of doubt also that why do they drink?"]],[5823,["They think by drinking they will become joyous."]],[5830,["Now our understanding about ourselves has to be very clear-cut."]],[5836,["Specially, people don’t meditate."]],[5841,["They just don’t meditate. They don’t want to grow."]],[5845,["They are Sahaja Yogis but they don’t meditate. It’s very surprising,"]],[5850,["I can make out who meditates, who does not, because there is no depth."]],[5856,["They want to have this, they want to have that, is all right, but what about meditation?"]],[5863,["If you don’t meditate, your Agnya will be completely covered with thoughts,"]],[5870,["and you’ll be lost. So you have to meditate."]],[5876,["If you don’t meditate, I also suffer."]],[5880,["If you have no aspirations in Sahaja Yoga it's better to leave,"]],[5885,["because you are like seeds which are sprouted and which will be wasted."]],[5891,["Some people are here because they want some sort of a platform, some publicity."]],[5899,["Some are here who want money, to make money out of Sahaja Yoga."]],[5904,["There are some who want to have a kind of a communication,"]],[5908,["to go round the whole world without paying a single pai."]],[5913,["All such people are of no use to themselves."]],[5921,["Now here you have the complete wealth."]],[5929,["All that celestial wealth is before you, and you are not going to accept it,"]],[5938,["you are not going to drown into it. What should we say?"]],[5943,["It’s not very sensible to do."]],[5945,["As I said, you don’t have to crucify yourself, you don’t have to give up anything,"]],[5950,["you don’t have to live like Christ had to live or be born in the manger."]],[5956,["All that’s done for you already. Now come along."]],[5962,["But if you are coming in the darbar of the Divine, then be worth it."]],[5971,["You should be worth it."]],[5972,["And you’ll be surprised, all your problems will be solved."]],[5976,["Your self-respect will be maintained. So many things have happened like that,"]],[5984,["but if you have no self-respect, you don’t respect your Realization,"]],[5989,["you are not deeply involved as to your own ascent and the help to others,"]],[5996,["it will not work out."]],[5998,["I’m here to tell you all these things which Christ could not tell."]],[6002,["I had to fulfil what  He wanted to say."]],[6008,["All those things I am saying to you. It has already worked,"]],[6013,["you all have got Realization,"]],[6015,["but develop respect for yourself as Sahaja yogis."]],[6019,["Don’t have funny ideas about yourself."]],[6023,["Just know you are a Sahaja yogi and a Sahaja yogini."]],[6027,["That’s what is needed for a person if he is today celebrating the birth of Christ."]],[6036,["He came on this Earth who was actually Christ, full of innocence,"]],[6046,["who was the One who came as the embodiment of Shri Ganesha."]],[6056,["I have given the proof of it to you, how the carbon atom looks like,"]],[6063,["and by which I have proved that Christ is the Alpha and Omega,"]],[6069,["while He is made out of Omkara and Swastika."]],[6075,["All this we have experimented. We have found it. It’s there."]],[6080,["With all this, what is the greatest achievement is to respect your innocence."]],[6088,["Respect your innocence."]],[6090,["This is what is to be asked for today: be innocent,"]],[6096,["and God looks after all the innocent people."]],[6101,["Don’t worry, don’t have to worry. I’ve seen children falling for seven storeys,"]],[6107,["nothing happens to them."]],[6109,["They are perfectly all right. How? Who looks after them? Angels."]],[6114,["You have seen photographs of angels around you."]],[6118,["So try to be simple, innocent, not reactive,"]],[6124,["and keep quiet and peaceful because here we are talking about the global transformation"]],[6133,["where people will find their peace in their heart"]],[6136,["and will establish a new world of peace, joy and spirituality."]],[6146,["May God bless you all!"]]]);
